\newlabel{fig:optimizer_average_ranks}{{19}{35}{Descriptive average ranks of the five optimizers across 12 matched backbone--seed blocks (four backbones and three common seeds). Rankings use locked-test MCC under the MCC/$F_1$ protocol and locked-test accuracy under the weighted-accuracy protocol. Error bars denote one standard deviation of block-level ranks; lower average rank is better. No significance test is implied by this visualization}{figure.19}{}}
